1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Monsoon rains are shifting, and Bangladesh's aquifers are draining fast.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,500
A single-season advisory is no longer enough.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,500
FieldShift harnesses 25 years of NASA Earth observations

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,200
to build multi-season, resilient crop rotation plans.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,200
Watch recommendations adapt: drought-resilient mustard in Rajshahi,

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,200
high-yield flood-safe boro rice in the haor basin.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,800
Accessible to every farmer by web and SMS. 100% offline.

8
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,000
